### Create a New Post
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Post",
  "content": "This is a test post content with enough characters to meet the minimum requirement.",
  "sender": {
    "id": 123,
    "name": "John Doe"
  }
}

###

### Get All Posts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts

###

### Get Post by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts/69738d2fc742184ae8b302a5

###

### Get Posts by Sender
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts?senderId=123

