### Update a Post
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/posts/697dce5a70a3a6007f1ae136
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Post Title",
  "content": "This is the updated content of the post. It has been modified with new information.",
  "sender": {
    "id": 123,
    "name": "John Doe"
  }
}

